    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Inspecting Webpages\r\n\r\nUse the **Tag Inspector** to reveal the hidden code behind the site\r\n- **HTML elements** define the *structure* of the page.\r\n- **CSS rules** define the *style* (colors, fonts, spacing, etc.).\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Explore:** Hover over different parts of the webpage and watch the **Tag Inspector** update on the right.\r\n2. **Find:** Identify at least **2 HTML tags** and **2 CSS rules**.\r\n3. **Investigate:** Pick one element you found and ask AI tutor:\r\n   - *\"What does [element] do?\"*, OR\r\n   - Make a guess and ask, \"Am I right that [element] does this?\"\r\n\r\nOnce AI Tutor explains the element to you, click **Continue**.",
