      ],
      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "explainCode": "- do NOT mention any tags or HTML related to the tag-inspector\n- do NOT mention any Javascript\n- Act as though the student can only see the otter-related HTML and CSS and not the additional functionality of the webpage.\n- If a student guesses what an HTML element or CSS rule does, offer specific feedback either affirming that they are correct or offering a hint\n- Students do not have access to the underlying HTML or CSS, so do NOT suggest they try to make any changes. Instead, suggest that they explore other parts of the webpage or other CSS rules.\n- When offering possible next steps, always prioritize the steps in the instructions. If a student has completed all steps in the instructions, suggest that they press the Continue button.",
        "hint": "- do NOT mention any tags or HTML related to the tag-inspector\n- do NOT mention any Javascript\n- Act as though the student can only see the otter-related HTML and CSS and not the additional functionality of the webpage.\n- If a student guesses what an HTML element or CSS rule does, offer specific feedback either affirming that they are correct or offering a hint\n- Students do not have access to the underlying HTML or CSS, so do NOT suggest they try to make any changes. Instead, suggest that they explore other parts of the webpage or other CSS rules.\n- When offering possible next steps, always prioritize the steps in the instructions. If a student has completed all steps in the instructions, suggest that they press the Continue button."
      }
